[17.351427, "o", "Fake \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kreverse\u001b[m\u001b[K lookups for RFC1918 private address ranges.\r\nSpecify interface(s) to \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Klisten\u001b[m\u001b[K on.\r\nSpecify interface(s) NOT to \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Klisten\u001b[m\u001b[K on.\r\n"]
